{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/eb1b6621e7c733c244ff4fbefbc67dc8.poster.avif?t=1764068507\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/eb1b6621e7c733c244ff4fbefbc67dc8.webm?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/eb1b6621e7c733c244ff4fbefbc67dc8.mp4?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl opens her eyes in a desolate world, and hears &quot;your&quot; voice from in front of the screen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can direct her actions, help her solve mysteries, evade dangers, and find a way to leave this place. Of course, you could also choose not to do so, or even worse, deliberately guide her to death... Just kidding, you surely wouldn't do that, right? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/23d75e7d0d63894e2009f6e10013a5ef.avif?t=1764068507\" width=620 height=150 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All characters are voiced.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The voice of the main character, Alice, is provided by Yoshino Aoyama, who also played the main character, Goto Hitori, in the popular anime &quot;Bocchi the Rock!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her passionate performance breathes a unique life into the character of Alice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Alice as she uncovers the true secrets of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no role-playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are who you are, the one who guides Alice in front of the screen.<br>You can be honest, you can be deceitful, you can help, you can destroy.<br>But don't forget, you can't hide behind another identity.<br>She'll remember - remember everything you've done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/776faab0afaab0d680a0a095315c3260.poster.avif?t=1764068507\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/776faab0afaab0d680a0a095315c3260.webm?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/776faab0afaab0d680a0a095315c3260.mp4?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the barren world of</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faraway towers, uninhabited ruins, and unknown monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead her onward to witness the wreckage left behind and their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/cc00e27d929f22913474056a5bb5a528.poster.avif?t=1764068507\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/cc00e27d929f22913474056a5bb5a528.webm?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/cc00e27d929f22913474056a5bb5a528.mp4?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine items and puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items obtained from the scene can trigger different interactive effects. <br> Combine props to explore more possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/aaf7659ddf3c3408b0033671acd82984.poster.avif?t=1764068507\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/aaf7659ddf3c3408b0033671acd82984.webm?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/aaf7659ddf3c3408b0033671acd82984.mp4?t=1764068507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439560/extras/190734fac014b8f11bc6dfb0c1323905.avif?t=1764068507\" width=620 height=418 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hello, World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2439560/1e573f37ddea800a79b5ec1ab9359a2a8a6abd3d.jpg"},{"name":"Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2439560/1fe7ba62f0f9fa767735b78fa8992e5be4410b5c.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2439560/6538a77c343a5f9dce11fe7f01ae651a4b70ab93.jpg"},{"name":"I'll Always Be With You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2439560/bedc47dcd86a065e51efd5376f9420a08bb49a27.jpg"},{"name":"A Real Kemonomimi Princess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2439560/c187d3696e5e22c9dea7a9ab4715a113ff9468cc.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Worry, We're Always Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2439560/6d2fadad6c5e8127d4b160b00e8475153156e9a0.jpg"},{"name":"Friendship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam